      "message": "docs: address review feedback on webhook design plan\n\nFix three issues:\n- High: workflow_name/workflow_path become Option<String> with .or()\n  preservation in StateStore (prevents null workflow erasing metadata)\n- Medium: clarify HMAC ownership \u2014 verify_signature() is stateless,\n  optionality is a Phase 9 server concern (DoD now matches architecture)\n- Medium: add waiting fixture to AC5.3 (real capture or synthetic)\n\nAlso adds AC3.6-AC3.8 for workflow preservation behavior.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
